WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

4
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

5
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

6
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

7
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

8
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

9
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

10
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

11
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

12
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

13
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

14
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

15
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

16
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

17
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

18
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

19
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

20
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

21
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

22
01:53.192 --> 01:55.816
=Episode 19=

23
02:07.464 --> 02:08.650
(Mr. Dong)

24
02:08.650 --> 02:10.210
(Ms. Xu transferred the payment.)

25
02:12.251 --> 02:12.851
That's great.

26
02:15.624 --> 02:16.251
(Lu Hui)

27
02:16.251 --> 02:17.531
(You got what you wanted.)

28
02:18.131 --> 02:19.610
(Don't forget our deal.)

29
02:24.291 --> 02:25.011
Hello, Mr. Dong.

30
02:25.490 --> 02:26.730
Go over the factory contract.

31
02:27.170 --> 02:28.371
Finance kept quiet

32
02:28.411 --> 02:29.691
about Ms. Xu's transfer,

33
02:30.011 --> 02:31.691
so Mrs. Di took advantage of the gap.

34
02:32.251 --> 02:33.251
By her signing authority,

35
02:33.490 --> 02:34.691
she rushed work through legal

36
02:34.770 --> 02:35.610
and finance.

37
02:36.131 --> 02:37.050
Jinghua has already

38
02:37.050 --> 02:37.811
signed a new factory

39
02:38.011 --> 02:38.851
and placed orders.

40
02:39.730 --> 02:40.371
Go on.

41
02:40.971 --> 02:41.770
Also,

42
02:42.291 --> 02:43.251
she already

43
02:43.251 --> 02:45.050
sent the share transfer deal to the board,

44
02:45.811 --> 02:46.770
applying

45
02:46.890 --> 02:47.971
to take over the 45% stake

46
02:48.011 --> 02:49.411
under her dad's name.

47
02:49.971 --> 02:51.011
Since it's compliant,

48
02:51.571 --> 02:52.691
almost nobody objected.

49
02:53.811 --> 02:54.371
Good.

50
02:56.091 --> 02:57.411
Help speed up the process.

51
02:58.210 --> 02:59.770
Let her get the shares sooner.

52
03:00.291 --> 03:00.730
Okay.

53
03:01.411 --> 03:01.851
By the way,

54
03:03.291 --> 03:04.251
reach out to

55
03:04.490 --> 03:05.650
minority shareholders looking

56
03:05.691 --> 03:06.170
to sell.

57
03:06.930 --> 03:08.131
Tell them I'm looking to buy.

58
03:08.610 --> 03:09.131
Understood.

59
03:17.768 --> 03:18.984
(Ms. Xu)

60
03:21.770 --> 03:23.131
I know you will blame me,

61
03:23.411 --> 03:24.730
but you're at fault too.

62
03:25.371 --> 03:27.450
Blame yourself for not keeping your people in check.

63
03:27.890 --> 03:28.291
Who?

64
03:28.770 --> 03:30.251
Your housekeeper is quite capable.

65
03:42.248 --> 03:42.856
(Lu Hui)

66
03:43.011 --> 03:43.650
Sorry,

67
03:43.890 --> 03:44.811
the number you dialed

68
03:44.851 --> 03:46.011
is currently unavailable.

69
03:46.411 --> 03:47.571
Please try again later.

70
03:48.050 --> 03:48.571
Sorry...

71
03:56.170 --> 03:56.851
Wrong password.

72
04:02.411 --> 04:03.371
Wrong password.

73
04:12.776 --> 04:17.384
(Haoyu)

74
04:20.171 --> 04:20.931
Where did you go?

75
04:21.970 --> 04:22.530
I'm outside.

76
04:23.450 --> 04:24.131
Stop prying.

77
04:24.691 --> 04:25.811
If Mom keeps that attitude

78
04:25.811 --> 04:26.491
and mindset,

79
04:26.931 --> 04:27.890
I'm not going home.

80
04:29.491 --> 04:31.131
Why hold a grudge against your mom?

81
04:32.251 --> 04:33.210
Come talk to me.

82
04:34.371 --> 04:35.770
If you want to lobby for her,

83
04:36.251 --> 04:36.731
forget it.

84
04:38.691 --> 04:39.970
Didn't you want me to choose

85
04:39.970 --> 04:41.251
between Yu Meng and your mom?

86
04:42.530 --> 04:43.691
Want to hear my answer?

87
04:45.611 --> 04:47.131
Tell me. What is it?

88
04:49.171 --> 04:50.450
Haven't skipped stones in ages.

89
04:53.330 --> 04:53.770
Here.

90
04:54.290 --> 04:54.931
Want to try?

91
04:59.890 --> 05:01.011
You hated being hospitalized.

92
05:02.731 --> 05:03.611
Every time,

93
05:04.210 --> 05:05.450
you made me pinky swear

94
05:05.731 --> 05:07.251
to play this with you

95
05:07.811 --> 05:08.811
after discharge.

96
05:10.850 --> 05:11.970
Remember how many times you

97
05:11.970 --> 05:13.571
begged me to take you skipping stones?

98
05:14.691 --> 05:15.650
23 times.

99
05:17.491 --> 05:18.330
It means

100
05:18.330 --> 05:19.611
you were hospitalized 23 times.

101
05:20.051 --> 05:21.090
Fortunately,

102
05:21.491 --> 05:23.290
after your surgery at 15,

103
05:23.450 --> 05:24.611
no more hospital stays for you.

104
05:33.611 --> 05:35.090
You looked happy back then,

105
05:36.171 --> 05:37.371
but I didn't,

106
05:39.131 --> 05:40.290
because you were sensible.

107
05:41.371 --> 05:41.970
You knew

108
05:42.011 --> 05:42.931
we spent everything

109
05:43.090 --> 05:43.731
treating you.

110
05:44.210 --> 05:45.210
Your mom was scared

111
05:45.770 --> 05:47.011
a park would overexcite you,

112
05:47.410 --> 05:48.171
making you sicker.

113
05:50.571 --> 05:51.131
So you never

114
05:51.171 --> 05:52.011
threw a tantrum once

115
05:52.051 --> 05:53.051
to go to a theme park.

116
05:53.571 --> 05:55.051
That's why on my tenth birthday,

117
05:56.171 --> 05:57.171
you secretly took me

118
05:57.210 --> 05:58.011
to a theme park.

119
05:59.251 --> 06:00.410
That's our secret.

120
06:00.650 --> 06:01.850
You must never tell your mom,

121
06:02.731 --> 06:04.011
or she'll scold us both.

122
06:04.290 --> 06:05.131
I argued with her.

123
06:06.090 --> 06:07.051
Why would I tell her?

124
06:07.571 --> 06:08.530
Speaking of which,

125
06:09.131 --> 06:10.171
I have to call you out.

126
06:10.890 --> 06:11.850
I wanted to talk

127
06:11.850 --> 06:12.770
with your mom,

128
06:13.491 --> 06:14.931
but because you ran away,

129
06:15.850 --> 06:16.770
she's heartbroken

130
06:17.371 --> 06:18.210
and has no patience

131
06:18.251 --> 06:19.090
to talk with me.

132
06:19.090 --> 06:20.330
She always sees me as a child.

133
06:21.011 --> 06:21.970
She tells me nothing

134
06:22.890 --> 06:23.890
and never asks my opinion.

135
06:24.210 --> 06:25.210
She booked a flight fast

136
06:25.210 --> 06:26.011
to drag me abroad.

137
06:28.491 --> 06:29.090
Even so,

138
06:29.090 --> 06:30.371
you shouldn't have run away

139
06:30.611 --> 06:31.450
and upset her.

140
06:32.210 --> 06:33.090
There are many ways

141
06:33.171 --> 06:33.770
to fix this.

142
06:34.131 --> 06:34.850
You shouldn't

143
06:34.850 --> 06:36.090
pick the most reckless one.

144
06:38.491 --> 06:39.650
About going abroad,

145
06:40.450 --> 06:41.051
I can help you

146
06:41.210 --> 06:42.251
change your mom's mind.

147
06:46.770 --> 06:47.251
Really?

148
06:48.051 --> 06:49.131
On one condition:

149
06:49.611 --> 06:50.811
you must get her to meet me.

150
06:51.272 --> 06:52.008
(Yue+DECO)

151
06:52.691 --> 06:53.171
(Mom,)

152
06:53.450 --> 06:54.290
(at 2:00 PM,)

153
06:54.611 --> 06:55.450
(come here, please.)

154
07:01.611 --> 07:02.051
Hui.

155
07:09.890 --> 07:10.530
Why is it you?

156
07:11.931 --> 07:12.491
Where's Haoyu?

157
07:13.410 --> 07:13.890
Sit.

158
07:25.171 --> 07:26.131
He's fine right now.

159
07:27.210 --> 07:28.371
He doesn't want to see you.

160
07:28.731 --> 07:30.011
You used my son to lure me out?

161
07:31.171 --> 07:31.890
Despicable.

162
07:32.051 --> 07:34.090
You helped Yu Meng handle Ms. Xu

163
07:34.850 --> 07:35.491
and betrayed me.

164
07:35.931 --> 07:36.450
Not despicable?

165
07:40.290 --> 07:41.290
I knew it.

166
07:42.890 --> 07:44.290
I never thought someone close to me

167
07:44.611 --> 07:45.931
would treat me like this.

168
07:46.650 --> 07:47.611
You even want

169
07:47.611 --> 07:49.090
to secretly take our son abroad.

170
07:49.931 --> 07:51.450
Do you think you can just walk away

171
07:51.650 --> 07:52.890
with him that easily?

172
07:53.650 --> 07:54.611
I need money right now.

173
07:55.210 --> 07:56.371
Give it back,

174
07:56.890 --> 07:58.171
or don't think about leaving

175
07:58.251 --> 07:59.171
with our son.

176
08:01.571 --> 08:02.691
That's your true face.

177
08:03.450 --> 08:04.691
You claimed this money

178
08:04.770 --> 08:06.011
was put aside for him,

179
08:06.450 --> 08:07.491
but you never intended

180
08:07.491 --> 08:08.330
to leave it to him.

181
08:09.131 --> 08:09.811
Everything I have

182
08:09.890 --> 08:10.970
belongs to our son.

183
08:11.890 --> 08:13.290
And he matters more than money.

184
08:14.611 --> 08:15.530
I can give all I have

185
08:15.530 --> 08:16.410
to him,

186
08:16.450 --> 08:17.491
but not right now.

187
08:18.691 --> 08:19.770
I need the money

188
08:19.850 --> 08:20.770
to secure my footing.

189
08:21.090 --> 08:22.090
To be honest,

190
08:23.051 --> 08:24.450
Yu Meng has asked for a divorce,

191
08:25.450 --> 08:26.450
but I haven't agreed yet.

192
08:26.650 --> 08:27.450
Don't be mad.

193
08:27.811 --> 08:28.850
Why would I?

194
08:35.851 --> 08:37.091
I've been stalling the divorce

195
08:38.050 --> 08:38.971
because Yu Jianguo

196
08:38.971 --> 08:40.410
held the 45% stake

197
08:40.851 --> 08:42.410
in Jiali.

198
08:44.091 --> 08:44.930
If I divorced her,

199
08:45.371 --> 08:46.570
I wouldn't get any shares.

200
08:47.251 --> 08:48.491
But now it's different.

201
08:49.211 --> 08:50.530
She has finished the paperwork

202
08:50.650 --> 08:51.930
and officially holds the shares.

203
08:52.530 --> 08:53.371
If we divorce now,

204
08:53.530 --> 08:54.371
I can split shares

205
08:54.410 --> 08:55.570
50-50 with her.

206
08:55.851 --> 08:57.331
The urgent priority is

207
08:57.530 --> 08:58.451
to buy out the shares

208
08:58.570 --> 09:00.011
from the minority shareholders,

209
09:00.331 --> 09:01.410
so that when we divorce,

210
09:01.650 --> 09:02.451
I can ensure

211
09:02.570 --> 09:04.050
I hold more shares than her.

212
09:04.491 --> 09:06.211
Only then can I take full control of Jiali.

213
09:07.011 --> 09:08.410
That's why I need the money.

214
09:08.491 --> 09:09.410
After all that talk,

215
09:09.851 --> 09:11.050
it's all about yourself.

216
09:11.451 --> 09:12.091
In your heart,

217
09:12.211 --> 09:13.410
you always come first.

218
09:14.410 --> 09:15.170
Protecting myself

219
09:15.290 --> 09:16.451
is what matters most.

220
09:17.131 --> 09:18.570
If I can't even protect myself,

221
09:18.890 --> 09:19.690
how am I supposed

222
09:19.690 --> 09:20.810
to take care of you two?

223
09:21.530 --> 09:22.810
Well, I'm not like you.

224
09:23.491 --> 09:24.170
I'd give my life

225
09:24.170 --> 09:24.930
for my son,

226
09:25.491 --> 09:26.011
unlike you.

227
09:29.131 --> 09:30.131
Until you drop your bias

228
09:30.211 --> 09:31.251
against me,

229
09:31.890 --> 09:33.170
nothing I say will matter.

230
09:36.451 --> 09:37.890
Just listen to me.

231
09:38.371 --> 09:39.570
Go to the bank with me now

232
09:39.770 --> 09:40.731
and transfer the money.

233
09:43.770 --> 09:45.050
To avoid drawing attention

234
09:46.371 --> 09:47.131
and keep them

235
09:47.410 --> 09:48.810
from tracing the funds,

236
09:49.331 --> 09:50.290
I split the money

237
09:50.290 --> 09:51.091
across several banks

238
09:51.331 --> 09:52.770
into various investment portfolios.

239
09:53.331 --> 09:53.930
So

240
09:54.331 --> 09:54.930
it's impossible

241
09:55.050 --> 09:56.050
to take it all out at once.

242
09:56.810 --> 09:58.050
Then today I only want the cash

243
09:58.050 --> 09:59.211
you currently have.

244
10:00.170 --> 10:00.530
Come.

245
10:01.251 --> 10:01.650
Let go!

246
10:01.650 --> 10:01.930
Move!

247
10:05.451 --> 10:05.971
Ma'am,

248
10:06.091 --> 10:06.851
your card balance

249
10:06.851 --> 10:07.770
is 730 thousand yuan.

250
10:07.890 --> 10:08.611
Sign on the pad

251
10:08.611 --> 10:09.530
to confirm it.

252
10:10.371 --> 10:11.011
(Remittance Application) Check it over.

253
10:11.011 --> 10:11.731
The right account?

254
10:18.472 --> 10:19.624
(Applicant's Name)

255
10:19.624 --> 10:22.056
(Help)

256
10:27.930 --> 10:28.410
Ma'am,

257
10:28.570 --> 10:29.410
your transaction

258
10:29.410 --> 10:30.211
needs backend review.

259
10:30.410 --> 10:31.011
Wait a moment.

260
10:33.091 --> 10:33.690
What's wrong?

261
10:35.371 --> 10:36.650
It's standard bank procedure.

262
10:40.251 --> 10:40.930
Please wait.

263
10:46.491 --> 10:47.611
Does this lady need help?

264
10:47.650 --> 10:48.331
Help me.

265
10:49.211 --> 10:49.611
He is

266
10:49.611 --> 10:50.530
going for all my money.

267
10:51.971 --> 10:52.371
Sir,

268
10:52.770 --> 10:53.971
please show your ID.

269
10:58.211 --> 10:59.211
It's a misunderstanding.

270
11:01.050 --> 11:01.810
She used to be

271
11:01.890 --> 11:02.611
our housekeeper.

272
11:03.131 --> 11:03.770
We know each other.

273
11:04.131 --> 11:04.930
I don't know him!

274
11:05.810 --> 11:06.530
He threatened me

275
11:07.410 --> 11:08.410
to transfer money to him!

276
11:09.091 --> 11:09.770
Call the police.

277
11:10.290 --> 11:10.650
Okay.

278
11:10.890 --> 11:11.410
Wait.

279
11:12.456 --> 11:13.704
What's going on?

280
11:15.731 --> 11:16.650
Think this through.

281
11:17.050 --> 11:18.091
If you escalate this

282
11:18.690 --> 11:19.650
to the police,

283
11:20.251 --> 11:21.611
neither of us gets out clean.

284
11:23.752 --> 11:24.936
What a mess.

285
11:26.331 --> 11:27.451
It's a misunderstanding.

286
11:28.050 --> 11:28.930
She used to be

287
11:28.971 --> 11:29.650
our housekeeper.

288
11:30.011 --> 11:30.611
I can provide

289
11:30.611 --> 11:31.491
her work contract.

290
11:32.810 --> 11:33.731
She borrowed some money

291
11:33.851 --> 11:34.690
from me,

292
11:35.331 --> 11:36.211
then suddenly quit

293
11:36.211 --> 11:36.851
and disappeared.

294
11:37.650 --> 11:38.810
So I came to get it back.

295
11:39.530 --> 11:40.011
Of course,

296
11:40.570 --> 11:41.410
I can go with you

297
11:41.530 --> 11:42.810
and assist with the inquiry.

298
11:44.331 --> 11:44.890
Are you going?

299
11:48.530 --> 11:48.770
Go.

300
11:49.331 --> 11:49.770
I'm going.

301
11:59.570 --> 12:00.451
I just remembered

302
12:00.451 --> 12:01.491
I got other stuff to do.

303
12:01.810 --> 12:02.410
How about this?

304
12:04.091 --> 12:04.810
As for the money,

305
12:05.091 --> 12:06.131
I'll give you a few more days.

306
12:07.170 --> 12:08.371
I'll be back.

307
12:10.930 --> 12:11.570
Thank you.

308
12:13.371 --> 12:14.530
I'll settle it privately.

309
12:27.731 --> 12:28.371
Sorry.

310
12:33.371 --> 12:35.451
Congratulations on launching Jinghua's production!

311
12:35.530 --> 12:37.290
It'll definitely be a huge hit once released.

312
12:37.451 --> 12:38.011
We should

313
12:38.011 --> 12:39.050
also thank Mr. Jiao

314
12:39.170 --> 12:39.731
for finding us

315
12:39.770 --> 12:41.131
such a wonderful park.

316
12:43.251 --> 12:43.890
- Come on. - Cheers!

317
12:44.251 --> 12:44.570
Cheers!

318
12:44.570 --> 12:46.091
Thanks for your congratulations, Zi.

319
12:46.131 --> 12:47.050
Cheers!

320
12:47.091 --> 12:48.011
Cheers!

321
12:50.184 --> 12:57.256
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

322
12:57.800 --> 13:03.848
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

323
13:04.744 --> 13:11.944
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

324
13:12.360 --> 13:17.736
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

325
13:18.971 --> 13:19.930
What a coincidence.

326
13:20.410 --> 13:21.770
Running into someone I know here.

327
13:22.770 --> 13:24.011
The one in the wheelchair

328
13:24.050 --> 13:24.690
is Weng Xin,

329
13:24.971 --> 13:25.770
Han Guang's wife.

330
13:27.251 --> 13:27.770
Yeah.

331
13:29.371 --> 13:31.290
Weng Yue's older sister.

332
13:31.650 --> 13:32.971
She looks about my age.

333
13:33.731 --> 13:34.810
When checking Han Guang's info,

334
13:34.810 --> 13:35.371
I learned

335
13:36.290 --> 13:37.211
she's two years older than you.

336
13:40.251 --> 13:40.810
How about

337
13:41.050 --> 13:42.011
I go say hello?

338
13:44.690 --> 13:45.251
Forget it.

339
13:45.770 --> 13:46.611
Don't disturb her.

340
13:53.096 --> 13:54.760
(Wu Ta)

341
13:56.331 --> 13:56.890
Zi,

342
13:56.971 --> 13:58.491
(Wu Ta) what are you making for me?

343
13:59.170 --> 14:01.170
A Manhattan for you.

344
14:03.650 --> 14:04.371
Welcome.

345
14:07.851 --> 14:08.890
What are you doing here?

346
14:12.530 --> 14:13.251
Welcome.

347
14:13.530 --> 14:14.890
Haoyu hasn't come home in days.

348
14:16.211 --> 14:17.530
He won't answer my calls either.

349
14:18.491 --> 14:19.890
I want you to talk to him for me.

350
14:20.211 --> 14:21.491
Harry has indeed

351
14:22.251 --> 14:23.451
been staying at the club.

352
14:24.451 --> 14:25.690
Listen,

353
14:26.650 --> 14:27.611
he's a human being,

354
14:28.011 --> 14:28.851
not an object.

355
14:29.690 --> 14:31.170
He has his own choices to make.

356
14:32.690 --> 14:33.530
Even if I

357
14:33.530 --> 14:34.690
kick him out today,

358
14:35.211 --> 14:36.290
if he refuses to go home,

359
14:36.851 --> 14:38.170
he'll still find endless ways

360
14:38.211 --> 14:39.011
to defy you.

361
14:39.491 --> 14:40.211
To be honest,

362
14:41.251 --> 14:42.131
I have my own reasons

363
14:42.211 --> 14:43.331
to take him abroad

364
14:45.011 --> 14:46.290
as soon as possible.

365
14:47.810 --> 14:49.131
He listens to you more right now.

366
14:49.371 --> 14:50.170
I have no choice

367
14:50.170 --> 14:50.930
but to come to you.

368
14:51.290 --> 14:52.170
Because of Di Liren?

369
14:55.851 --> 14:56.930
Di Liren and I...

370
14:58.050 --> 14:59.251
I can't stop him.

371
14:59.851 --> 15:01.050
I won't touch his stuff again,

372
15:01.530 --> 15:02.410
and I'm not able to.

373
15:03.611 --> 15:04.451
I am

374
15:04.570 --> 15:05.570
staying out of your feud.

375
15:06.410 --> 15:07.491
I want to live in peace

376
15:07.491 --> 15:08.371
with Haoyu.

377
15:08.770 --> 15:10.131
Things have gotten to this point.

378
15:11.690 --> 15:13.331
You can't just quit

379
15:13.930 --> 15:15.211
or walk away whenever you want.

380
15:15.570 --> 15:16.890
Haoyu is innocent.

381
15:18.170 --> 15:19.131
He's never done anything

382
15:19.170 --> 15:20.170
to hurt you.

383
15:21.131 --> 15:22.170
If he finds out,

384
15:22.211 --> 15:23.170
he can't take it.

385
15:23.731 --> 15:24.570
Since I already

386
15:24.570 --> 15:25.410
helped you,

387
15:26.170 --> 15:27.011
please help me too.

388
15:27.930 --> 15:28.570
Convince him

389
15:29.091 --> 15:30.331
to leave with me quickly, okay?

390
15:31.570 --> 15:32.451
Haoyu

391
15:32.451 --> 15:33.290
is my only family.

392
15:34.211 --> 15:34.890
At least...

393
15:37.331 --> 15:38.731
Please persuade him not to hate me.

394
15:39.331 --> 15:40.491
I won't tell him.

395
15:41.770 --> 15:42.690
But not for your sake.

396
15:43.410 --> 15:44.331
It's for Harry.

397
15:46.211 --> 15:47.690
I don't want the world

398
15:48.410 --> 15:49.890
he built inside his heart

399
15:50.770 --> 15:51.690
to collapse completely.

400
15:53.690 --> 15:54.810
Thank you on Haoyu's behalf.

401
15:56.890 --> 15:58.371
Honestly, I really envy you.

402
16:00.570 --> 16:02.851
You were born lucky and have everything,

403
16:03.851 --> 16:04.491
unlike me.

404
16:05.611 --> 16:06.650
I've been unlucky.

405
16:06.890 --> 16:08.211
How you ended up here today

406
16:09.091 --> 16:09.930
has nothing to do

407
16:09.971 --> 16:10.890
with luck.

408
16:11.650 --> 16:12.971
You chose this path yourself.

409
16:13.570 --> 16:14.650
You chose to be

410
16:14.650 --> 16:15.570
Di Liren's puppet.

411
16:16.251 --> 16:17.211
You chose

412
16:17.810 --> 16:19.131
to tie your whole life

413
16:19.770 --> 16:21.050
to a man.

414
16:21.530 --> 16:22.611
I had no choice at all!

415
16:23.331 --> 16:24.650
If my mom hadn't died young,

416
16:24.650 --> 16:25.650
if my dad hadn't died,

417
16:25.930 --> 16:26.731
or if our factory

418
16:26.770 --> 16:27.690
still existed,

419
16:28.731 --> 16:29.290
if I still

420
16:29.290 --> 16:30.650
had a place in Xiaocheng,

421
16:32.170 --> 16:33.570
I'd be way better off than you.

422
16:35.731 --> 16:36.451
But my hardships

423
16:36.451 --> 16:37.611
just never ended.

424
16:37.768 --> 16:38.851
(Xiaocheng, 21 years ago)

425
16:38.851 --> 16:39.851
(I really had no choice.)

426
16:40.530 --> 16:41.290
(Back then,)

427
16:41.331 --> 16:42.410
(when I was helpless,)

428
16:43.251 --> 16:44.371
(Di Liren was the only one)

429
16:44.371 --> 16:45.290
(willing to help me.)

430
16:46.170 --> 16:47.050
(He wasn't a choice.)

431
16:48.570 --> 16:49.690
(He was my lifesaver.)

432
16:50.290 --> 16:51.611
(We depended on each other)

433
16:52.131 --> 16:53.011
(and got married.)

434
16:53.690 --> 16:54.851
(Desperate to hold onto him,)

435
16:55.851 --> 16:57.251
(I tried to have a baby.)

436
16:58.170 --> 16:59.050
(Our child.)

437
17:00.131 --> 17:01.050
(But unexpectedly,)

438
17:01.770 --> 17:03.050
(as soon as he was born,)

439
17:04.130 --> 17:06.610
(he was diagnosed with congenital heart disease.)

440
17:07.651 --> 17:08.891
(To treat our child,)

441
17:10.211 --> 17:11.770
we sold everything we owned back then

442
17:12.651 --> 17:13.610
and borrowed money,

443
17:15.050 --> 17:15.931
but his condition

444
17:15.971 --> 17:17.050
didn't improve at all.

445
17:19.090 --> 17:19.971
I couldn't accept it.

446
17:21.090 --> 17:22.130
I really couldn't.

447
17:24.130 --> 17:24.850
And then?

448
17:27.290 --> 17:27.971
Have you ever

449
17:27.971 --> 17:29.171
seen a child suffocating?

450
17:30.770 --> 17:31.810
Purple lips,

451
17:32.491 --> 17:33.691
convulsing all over...

452
17:34.570 --> 17:35.731
He was so little,

453
17:36.850 --> 17:38.850
hurting too much to even cry,

454
17:39.651 --> 17:40.810
yet he tried to comfort me.

455
17:40.810 --> 17:41.211
He said...

456
17:44.090 --> 17:45.651
He said, "Mom, don't cry.

457
17:48.651 --> 17:50.211
Let's just stop the treatment."

458
17:52.770 --> 17:53.290
Later on,

459
17:55.411 --> 17:56.691
the doctor handed me

460
17:56.971 --> 17:57.931
the critical notice.

461
18:01.530 --> 18:02.770
A light piece of paper

462
18:04.651 --> 18:06.050
weighed me down

463
18:06.130 --> 18:06.731
so hard.

464
18:08.530 --> 18:09.171
(Liren...)

465
18:11.011 --> 18:12.451
(I saw him cry for the first time.)

466
18:13.330 --> 18:14.211
(The man)

467
18:14.211 --> 18:15.651
(who used to shield me)

468
18:16.850 --> 18:19.411
(clutched the payment slips, crouched in the corner,)

469
18:20.290 --> 18:21.570
(shivering like a falling leaf.)

470
18:22.891 --> 18:23.931
Back then, Haoyu was lying

471
18:24.090 --> 18:25.370
in the intensive care unit.

472
18:25.770 --> 18:26.931
The doctor told us

473
18:28.090 --> 18:29.691
that if he didn't get surgery soon...

474
18:32.651 --> 18:34.011
At our most desperate moment,

475
18:37.171 --> 18:38.090
you showed up.

476
18:40.651 --> 18:42.011
You fell in love with my husband.

477
18:49.090 --> 18:49.651
Lu Hui,

478
18:50.251 --> 18:51.451
if you two hadn't conspired

479
18:51.530 --> 18:52.290
to deceive me,

480
18:52.491 --> 18:53.330
none of this

481
18:53.330 --> 18:54.610
would have ever happened!

482
18:56.130 --> 18:57.370
Your child's life matters,

483
18:57.971 --> 18:58.570
but

484
18:58.570 --> 18:59.451
what about the others?

485
19:00.330 --> 19:01.251
If you two hadn't done

486
19:01.290 --> 19:02.171
those wicked things,

487
19:02.411 --> 19:03.330
my dad wouldn't be

488
19:03.370 --> 19:04.090
in a coma,

489
19:04.491 --> 19:05.211
and my mom

490
19:05.211 --> 19:06.171
wouldn't be threatened.

491
19:06.891 --> 19:07.570
As for me,

492
19:08.731 --> 19:09.651
I could have

493
19:10.610 --> 19:11.850
had a happy family

494
19:12.370 --> 19:13.330
and an adorable baby!

495
19:13.971 --> 19:15.171
What did I do wrong?

496
19:15.451 --> 19:16.651
Do you think I wanted this?

497
19:18.011 --> 19:19.451
Every night as I lay in bed,

498
19:20.370 --> 19:21.651
all I could think about was

499
19:22.330 --> 19:23.610
my husband with another woman!

500
19:24.451 --> 19:25.891
Every time Haoyu asked for his dad,

501
19:26.090 --> 19:27.731
I had to make up a new lie.

502
19:29.211 --> 19:30.411
Do you know

503
19:30.931 --> 19:31.411
how it felt

504
19:31.411 --> 19:32.211
watching Liren walk

505
19:32.211 --> 19:33.171
into your house?

506
19:34.370 --> 19:34.931
I felt like

507
19:36.411 --> 19:39.090
my heart was being ripped brutally

508
19:39.090 --> 19:40.011
in two!

509
19:41.810 --> 19:43.171
On one side was my child's life,

510
19:44.971 --> 19:46.530
and on the other was the only support

511
19:47.570 --> 19:49.211
keeping me alive!

512
19:51.891 --> 19:54.090
I personally sent the man I loved most

513
19:55.050 --> 19:56.731
into another woman's bed!

514
19:59.251 --> 20:00.330
But what else could I do?

515
20:02.451 --> 20:03.931
I could live a worthless life.

516
20:04.731 --> 20:06.011
I could throw away my dignity,

517
20:08.171 --> 20:09.370
but my child...

518
20:11.130 --> 20:12.011
My child

519
20:12.011 --> 20:13.691
never even got to see the world.

520
20:16.090 --> 20:17.330
Was he supposed to just die?

521
20:21.171 --> 20:22.411
I gave Di Liren up to you

522
20:23.330 --> 20:24.731
because I'm a mother!

523
20:25.770 --> 20:26.891
For my child,

524
20:27.931 --> 20:29.211
I had no choice!

525
20:35.570 --> 20:36.370
I feel for you,

526
20:37.891 --> 20:39.411
but that's no excuse

527
20:40.251 --> 20:41.891
for conspiring to steal our company

528
20:42.530 --> 20:43.810
and our family's assets.

529
20:44.050 --> 20:44.570
Jiali

530
20:44.971 --> 20:45.971
grew from a tiny

531
20:46.050 --> 20:47.011
cosmetics workshop

532
20:47.290 --> 20:48.731
to a big brand

533
20:49.731 --> 20:51.850
because Liren went all out for this!

534
20:52.971 --> 20:54.491
Every cent of Jiali's profit

535
20:55.211 --> 20:56.370
carries his blood and sweat!

536
20:57.290 --> 20:58.610
Every cent I received came

537
20:59.330 --> 21:01.090
from swallowing humiliation!

538
21:06.011 --> 21:06.451
Whatever.

539
21:08.370 --> 21:09.411
Stop that nonsense.

540
21:10.451 --> 21:11.610
I just want to tell you this:

541
21:12.570 --> 21:13.731
time will prove everything.

542
21:14.251 --> 21:15.931
Time will tell who was right and wrong.

543
21:20.251 --> 21:22.011
There's one thing I don't understand.

544
21:24.370 --> 21:25.370
Why did you save my dad?

545
21:26.050 --> 21:27.330
By your logic,

546
21:28.370 --> 21:29.850
shouldn't you have wanted him to die

547
21:30.570 --> 21:31.651
so you'd have the chance

548
21:32.491 --> 21:34.050
to swallow all of Jiali's shares?

549
21:34.530 --> 21:35.411
Believe it or not,

550
21:35.610 --> 21:36.850
I never wanted Jiali's shares.

551
21:36.891 --> 21:37.850
I only

552
21:38.810 --> 21:39.451
wanted

553
21:39.451 --> 21:40.530
what was rightfully mine.

554
21:41.451 --> 21:42.251
As for Mr. Yu,

555
21:42.971 --> 21:44.370
I never intended to harm him.

556
21:45.251 --> 21:46.570
When I saw him collapse,

557
21:48.011 --> 21:48.691
it was

558
21:48.691 --> 21:49.570
like seeing my dad.

559
21:50.891 --> 21:52.211
When my dad had a car accident,

560
21:53.411 --> 21:54.090
if someone

561
21:54.130 --> 21:55.050
had just helped him

562
21:56.050 --> 21:57.731
or called an ambulance earlier,

563
21:58.451 --> 21:59.570
he might not have died,

564
22:01.691 --> 22:02.491
and I wouldn't

565
22:02.491 --> 22:03.530
have lived like this now.

566
22:18.824 --> 22:22.504
(Wu TA)

567
22:25.610 --> 22:26.891
I'm counting on you.

568
22:27.610 --> 22:29.130
I know Di Liren well.

569
22:29.691 --> 22:31.130
Even if Harry agrees to go with you,

570
22:31.491 --> 22:32.411
Di Liren won't

571
22:32.411 --> 22:33.130
let you two go.

572
22:33.451 --> 22:34.090
He will.

573
22:34.770 --> 22:35.530
He wants money.

574
22:36.011 --> 22:37.330
Once Di Liren goes down,

575
22:38.290 --> 22:39.090
you'll be

576
22:39.130 --> 22:40.330
the first scapegoat.

577
22:40.810 --> 22:41.530
That's my business.

578
22:42.411 --> 22:43.171
I'll deal with it.

579
22:56.290 --> 22:57.411
I am thinking...

580
22:57.971 --> 22:59.130
You either

581
22:59.971 --> 23:01.090
conquer fate,

582
23:01.610 --> 23:02.770
or it conquers you.

583
23:03.691 --> 23:04.691
I choose the former.

584
23:05.171 --> 23:07.130
Yet she's still struggling.

585
23:07.691 --> 23:08.530
You've softened up?

586
23:08.891 --> 23:10.251
I have my own battle to fight.

587
23:24.451 --> 23:25.171
How did you get in?

588
23:25.850 --> 23:26.731
A locksmith helped.

589
23:28.130 --> 23:29.370
You changed your bank card PIN,

590
23:30.130 --> 23:31.691
and now even the door code.

591
23:32.171 --> 23:32.971
What are you up to?

592
23:35.290 --> 23:36.770
A real estate agent came today.

593
23:37.651 --> 23:38.651
To be safe,

594
23:38.651 --> 23:39.931
I changed the code temporarily.

595
23:42.770 --> 23:43.570
If you want to come,

596
23:43.810 --> 23:45.011
just call me.

597
23:46.011 --> 23:47.330
Why waste hundreds of yuan

598
23:47.971 --> 23:48.770
to pick the lock?

599
23:54.130 --> 23:54.931
Why did the agent come?

600
23:55.971 --> 23:57.171
What are you up to now?

601
23:57.570 --> 23:59.090
I was impulsive at the bank.

602
24:01.130 --> 24:02.491
I just felt

603
24:02.491 --> 24:04.050
reinvesting all our hard-earned money

604
24:04.971 --> 24:06.491
back into Jiali would

605
24:07.491 --> 24:08.731
leave Haoyu with no security

606
24:08.731 --> 24:09.451
for life.

607
24:09.850 --> 24:10.731
I'm scared.

608
24:11.171 --> 24:12.370
That's my money!

609
24:12.931 --> 24:13.691
Since when is it

610
24:13.731 --> 24:14.530
your call to make?

611
24:15.691 --> 24:16.691
Right now, to me,

612
24:17.330 --> 24:18.610
shares matter more than money.

613
24:19.891 --> 24:21.211
After all these years together,

614
24:22.050 --> 24:23.171
you actually held me back

615
24:23.251 --> 24:23.971
at the key moment.

616
24:24.050 --> 24:24.850
Don't get worked up.

617
24:25.050 --> 24:25.971
Let me finish.

618
24:26.610 --> 24:28.011
I wasn't lying to you before.

619
24:29.011 --> 24:30.810
I put the money in funds and insurance.

620
24:31.691 --> 24:32.411
You

621
24:32.850 --> 24:33.731
can only

622
24:33.731 --> 24:34.491
withdraw it

623
24:34.491 --> 24:35.530
after months of lock-up.

624
24:37.290 --> 24:38.251
If I don't get it now,

625
24:39.691 --> 24:40.931
I'm definitely not leaving.

626
24:42.211 --> 24:43.330
Don't try to brush me off

627
24:43.370 --> 24:44.090
with empty words.

628
24:52.330 --> 24:52.891
That's why

629
24:53.610 --> 24:54.691
(Property Purchase Agreement) I sold this apartment

630
24:55.411 --> 24:56.251
to the agency.

631
24:57.211 --> 24:57.971
Within seven days,

632
24:58.731 --> 24:59.931
we'll get the full payment.

633
25:00.770 --> 25:01.530
This apartment

634
25:01.530 --> 25:02.891
is worth at least 4 million now.

635
25:03.290 --> 25:03.971
How much did it go for?

636
25:04.290 --> 25:05.570
I discounted it by 10 percent.

637
25:05.971 --> 25:06.850
We lost a bit,

638
25:07.731 --> 25:08.731
but I've figured it out.

639
25:09.731 --> 25:11.050
Money can always be remade,

640
25:12.090 --> 25:13.411
but our family of three

641
25:13.931 --> 25:14.731
sticking together

642
25:15.451 --> 25:16.370
beats everything.

643
25:16.850 --> 25:18.011
There are also some stocks

644
25:18.491 --> 25:19.491
and overseas properties.

645
25:20.451 --> 25:21.011
I can

646
25:21.011 --> 25:22.130
liquidate them one by one.

647
25:22.931 --> 25:24.810
All these years, you've supported

648
25:24.810 --> 25:25.530
Haoyu and me.

649
25:27.011 --> 25:28.330
Now it's our turn to support you.

650
25:32.616 --> 25:33.928
(Your debit card ending in 7430)

651
25:33.928 --> 25:35.624
(received 1,080,000 RMB at 8:30 PM.)

652
25:36.251 --> 25:37.731
This message came in time.

653
25:38.931 --> 25:40.011
That is the 30%

654
25:40.011 --> 25:40.651
advance payment.

655
25:42.491 --> 25:43.050
Over the next

656
25:43.850 --> 25:44.570
seven days,

657
25:45.050 --> 25:46.570
I'll transfer the rest of the money

658
25:46.610 --> 25:47.530
to your card.

659
25:47.850 --> 25:49.330
It's not enough to buy the shares,

660
25:50.810 --> 25:51.411
but

661
25:51.891 --> 25:52.931
it's enough for a deposit.

662
25:59.330 --> 25:59.850
Hui,

663
26:00.610 --> 26:02.330
I'm so glad you see it this way.

664
26:05.570 --> 26:06.330
At the bank,

665
26:06.330 --> 26:07.290
I was too rash.

666
26:09.011 --> 26:09.891
Sorry about that.

667
26:13.810 --> 26:14.770
Everything will be fine.

668
26:26.290 --> 26:27.251
Where are you staying?

669
26:27.810 --> 26:28.931
At a hotel near you.

670
26:29.491 --> 26:30.370
Don't worry about me.

671
26:30.850 --> 26:32.011
You're alone at the company.

672
26:32.251 --> 26:33.211
Be extremely careful.

673
26:34.011 --> 26:35.130
Haoyu can't lose his father.

674
26:37.211 --> 26:37.731
Don't worry.

675
27:02.952 --> 27:04.808
(Divorce Agreement)

676
27:09.251 --> 27:10.251
Do we really have to

677
27:10.290 --> 27:11.050
do this?

678
27:11.370 --> 27:12.530
An uncontested divorce is

679
27:12.530 --> 27:13.290
your best option.

680
27:13.651 --> 27:15.171
It saves face for both of us.

681
27:16.011 --> 27:17.330
If we take this to court,

682
27:17.731 --> 27:18.251
things

683
27:18.251 --> 27:19.290
will get ugly.

684
27:20.411 --> 27:21.171
Threatening me?

685
27:27.330 --> 27:28.451
This is a threat.

686
27:33.096 --> 27:33.651
(Report on Jiali's Financial Irregularities)

687
27:33.651 --> 27:34.770
I'm helping you.

688
27:35.731 --> 27:36.770
Over the past few years,

689
27:36.770 --> 27:38.050
you've moved over 10 million abroad.

690
