1028
39:35.491 --> 39:35.971
Are we?

1029
39:36.730 --> 39:37.570
Be careful.

1030
39:38.170 --> 39:38.690
Oh, my!

1031
39:38.690 --> 39:43.371
♪Love makes one suffer♪

1032
39:43.451 --> 39:44.331
Keep it down!

1033
39:44.530 --> 39:45.650
Someone's going to complain.

1034
39:45.690 --> 39:46.530
I... I know.

1035
39:47.610 --> 39:49.210
I'm not drunk!

1036
39:49.291 --> 39:49.730
Okay.

1037
39:49.771 --> 39:50.610
I'm completely sober!

1038
39:51.371 --> 39:51.931
Mr. Jiao,

1039
39:52.570 --> 39:53.411
let me ask you.

1040
39:55.170 --> 39:55.811
Tell me.

1041
39:56.650 --> 39:57.971
I already bonded

1042
39:58.050 --> 39:59.210
with Chestnut.

1043
39:59.610 --> 40:00.210
Then why

1044
40:00.250 --> 40:01.451
won't Liu Zi accept me?

1045
40:02.690 --> 40:03.971
She will accept you.

1046
40:04.610 --> 40:05.050
Why?

1047
40:05.050 --> 40:05.891
She will accept you.

1048
40:06.090 --> 40:06.971
I swear,

1049
40:07.811 --> 40:08.931
starting today,

1050
40:09.730 --> 40:10.650
Liu Zi and I...

1051
40:11.130 --> 40:11.971
I'm blocking her!

1052
40:12.451 --> 40:13.291
Deleting her!

1053
40:14.891 --> 40:16.570
Completely formatting her

1054
40:16.811 --> 40:17.891
out of my life!

1055
40:19.170 --> 40:20.650
Don't go back to the club tonight.

1056
40:20.971 --> 40:21.730
Keep an eye on him.

1057
40:22.011 --> 40:23.090
Why do I have to watch him?

1058
40:23.411 --> 40:24.530
Because you're young.

1059
40:25.371 --> 40:25.811
You are young.

1060
40:25.811 --> 40:27.090
I can't handle him going crazy.

1061
40:27.291 --> 40:27.690
I'm off.

1062
40:27.730 --> 40:28.411
Wait...

1063
40:28.610 --> 40:29.291
Wait, Xu.

1064
40:29.451 --> 40:30.050
Xu.

1065
40:30.050 --> 40:30.650
Harry!

1066
40:30.730 --> 40:31.371
Let me ask you.

1067
40:32.610 --> 40:33.771
Am I not a good man?

1068
40:34.170 --> 40:34.891
You're good.

1069
40:35.291 --> 40:36.771
Right? I'm good, aren't I?

1070
40:38.730 --> 40:39.730
Just take him upstairs.

1071
40:39.891 --> 40:40.291
Xu!

1072
40:40.530 --> 40:41.891
Xu!

1073
40:43.011 --> 40:43.610
Unbelievable.

1074
40:46.011 --> 40:46.891
Dr. Kang!

1075
40:48.411 --> 40:49.011
This way.

1076
40:49.090 --> 40:49.690
Where to go?

1077
40:50.090 --> 40:50.971
We're going upstairs.

1078
40:51.451 --> 40:52.130
Why?

1079
40:52.690 --> 40:53.730
Because you're drunk.

1080
40:53.771 --> 40:54.411
And Liu Zi?

1081
40:54.730 --> 40:55.170
Liu Zi?

1082
40:55.610 --> 40:56.210
Forget her!

1083
40:58.811 --> 40:59.371
Mom,

1084
40:59.690 --> 41:01.011
did you

1085
41:01.250 --> 41:02.730
block Mr. Hedgehog?

1086
41:03.491 --> 41:04.811
Where did you learn that word?

1087
41:05.371 --> 41:06.491
Spelling quiz today.

1088
41:06.570 --> 41:07.411
Textbook packed?

1089
41:07.491 --> 41:08.170
No topic shift.

1090
41:09.331 --> 41:10.371
Did you fight

1091
41:10.411 --> 41:11.050
with him?

1092
41:11.771 --> 41:13.050
This is so typical of grown-ups.

1093
41:13.371 --> 41:15.891
Once you're upset, you cut people off.

1094
41:16.851 --> 41:18.050
We didn't fight.

1095
41:18.530 --> 41:19.771
Look, he made the honey cake

1096
41:19.811 --> 41:20.451
for you.

1097
41:23.570 --> 41:24.530
There's no way

1098
41:24.530 --> 41:25.730
Mr. Hedgehog made this.

1099
41:26.170 --> 41:27.530
His honey cake doesn't get hard

1100
41:27.730 --> 41:29.011
even after three days.

1101
41:29.451 --> 41:30.291
Yours is so bad

1102
41:31.011 --> 41:32.331
that even ants wouldn't touch it.

1103
41:34.050 --> 41:35.451
Just take it.

1104
41:35.530 --> 41:37.530
Stop being picky.

1105
41:40.170 --> 41:40.971
Why are you here?

1106
41:41.250 --> 41:42.210
I got breakfast for you.

1107
41:43.931 --> 41:45.250
Thanks, but I can't take it.

1108
41:46.411 --> 41:47.170
Mr. Kang.

1109
41:47.491 --> 41:48.011
Chestnut.

1110
41:48.250 --> 41:48.811
Mr. Kang,

1111
41:49.130 --> 41:50.851
why haven't you shown up for so long?

1112
41:51.570 --> 41:52.971
What goodies did you bring me?

1113
41:53.210 --> 41:54.011
I've been busy.

1114
41:54.331 --> 41:54.931
So,

1115
41:55.491 --> 41:56.811
today I brought you...

1116
41:58.331 --> 41:58.891
Make a guess.

1117
41:59.650 --> 42:00.771
I can't guess.

1118
42:01.210 --> 42:01.891
You can't?

1119
42:03.050 --> 42:04.210
Look, cookies!

1120
42:04.451 --> 42:05.451
Thank you, Mr. Kang!

1121
42:05.451 --> 42:06.170
You're welcome.

1122
42:07.971 --> 42:09.170
Your coffee and croissant.

1123
42:10.210 --> 42:11.130
Look, Mom!

1124
42:11.250 --> 42:11.851
Thank you.

1125
42:13.730 --> 42:14.411
They're so cute!

1126
42:14.411 --> 42:15.250
School bus's leaving.

1127
42:15.250 --> 42:15.971
Let's go.

1128
42:16.371 --> 42:17.331
Let me walk you over.

1129
42:17.730 --> 42:18.411
No need.

1130
42:26.771 --> 42:27.771
Do you like the cookies?

1131
42:28.491 --> 42:29.451
You finish them all.

1132
42:30.331 --> 42:32.011
After all, he's Chestnut's father.

1133
42:32.050 --> 42:33.451
Chestnut naturally feels close

1134
42:33.451 --> 42:34.411
to him.

1135
42:34.811 --> 42:35.610
What about you?

1136
42:36.090 --> 42:37.690
Have you gotten close with Dr. Kang?

1137
42:38.170 --> 42:39.371
Stop teasing.

1138
42:39.491 --> 42:40.690
I'm not teasing.

1139
42:40.811 --> 42:41.530
I'm serious.

1140
42:42.210 --> 42:42.891
Don't be silly.

1141
42:43.090 --> 42:43.690
Mr. Dong.

1142
42:44.730 --> 42:45.570
I have to go.

1143
42:46.090 --> 42:46.610
Bye.

1144
42:46.771 --> 42:47.130
Bye.

1145
42:47.650 --> 42:48.291
What is it?

1146
42:48.451 --> 42:49.011
Meng,

1147
42:49.170 --> 42:50.331
Jinghua is in trouble!

1148
42:53.960 --> 42:56.616
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1149
42:57.170 --> 42:57.891
A divorce is fine,

1150
42:58.210 --> 42:59.491
but I demand we share the debts.

1151
42:59.570 --> 43:00.771
The money went straight

1152
43:00.771 --> 43:01.650
(Transaction Statement) to your personal account.

1153
43:02.931 --> 43:04.050
How can you prove

1154
43:04.291 --> 43:05.411
(Transaction Statement) it was used for the company?

1155
43:05.971 --> 43:07.170
The lender can prove it.

1156
43:08.050 --> 43:08.811
Me?

1157
43:08.891 --> 43:09.811
I need to know

1158
43:10.130 --> 43:11.090
how Weng Xin

1159
43:11.090 --> 43:11.851
and Han Guang met,

1160
43:12.090 --> 43:12.811
when things

1161
43:12.811 --> 43:14.210
started going wrong,

1162
43:14.411 --> 43:15.851
and what illness she actually had.

1163
43:16.210 --> 43:17.210
Someone reported me?

1164
43:18.011 --> 43:19.130
We were only notified

1165
43:19.451 --> 43:20.011
your materials

1166
43:20.210 --> 43:20.931
were reported

1167
43:20.931 --> 43:21.530
for fraud info,

1168
43:21.971 --> 43:22.851
so sent back for review.

1169
43:24.170 --> 43:25.011
You reported me?

1170
43:26.331 --> 43:27.371
When did you put money

1171
43:27.411 --> 43:28.331
into a trust?

1172
43:43.720 --> 43:48.589
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1173
43:51.073 --> 43:55.936
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1174
43:58.394 --> 44:03.239
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1175
44:03.684 --> 44:10.186
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1176
44:12.918 --> 44:19.871
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1177
44:20.421 --> 44:26.351
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1178
44:27.475 --> 44:34.706
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1179
44:35.009 --> 44:40.182
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1180
44:40.802 --> 44:52.270
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1181
44:54.770 --> 45:00.018
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1182
45:02.059 --> 45:07.494
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1183
45:09.316 --> 45:14.713
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1184
45:14.713 --> 45:23.358
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1185
45:23.834 --> 45:31.397
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1186
45:31.397 --> 45:37.243
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1187
45:37.243 --> 45:47.410
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪

1188
45:47.410 --> 45:48.410
MkvDrama.net
